.TH HOMED 8 "October 2026" "homed 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
homed \- org.freedesktop.home1 compatibility D-Bus service
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B homed
provides a limited, read-only implementation of the org.freedesktop.home1 Manager interface for local NSS accounts. It is not a full systemd-homed replacement and does not manage encrypted home areas.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR busctl (1),
.BR dbus-daemon (1)
